{"id":"4307a2772edc1a3b","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-modular-multiplicative-order.md","title":"模 n 单位与乘法阶","display":"df-modular-multiplicative-order — 模 n 单位与乘法阶","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-modular-multiplicative-order","aliases":["73-df-modular-multiplicative-order"],"display":"df-modular-multiplicative-order — 模 n 单位与乘法阶","depends_on":["[[73-df-modular-exponentiation]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§11.5.2, print p. 516; PDF p. 538; degree interpreted as multiplicative order","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":11},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-modular-multiplicative-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-modular-multiplicative-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modular-multiplicative-order — 模 n 单位与乘法阶"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b39bd6838766ad96\" href=\"?note=b39bd6838766ad96\" title=\"73-df-modular-exponentiation\">73-df-modular-exponentiation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§11.5.2, print p. 516; PDF p. 538; degree interpreted as multiplicative order"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"11"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gcd(a,n)\">\\(\\gcd(a,n)\\)</span> 取自然数最大公约数。阶函数仅定义在下式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf U_n\">\\(\\mathsf U_n\\)</span> 上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf U_n\\coloneqq\\{a\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n-1\\}:\\gcd(a,n)=1\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ord}_n(a)\\coloneqq\\min\\{e\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}:\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,e)=1\\}\\quad(a\\in\\mathsf U_n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf U_n\\coloneqq\\{a\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n-1\\}:\\gcd(a,n)=1\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ord}_n(a)\\coloneqq\\min\\{e\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}:\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,e)=1\\}\\quad(a\\in\\mathsf U_n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ord}_n(a)\\in\\{1,\\ldots,|\\mathsf U_n|\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,e)=1\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{ord}_n(a)\\mid e\n\\quad(a\\in\\mathsf U_n,\\ e\\in\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ord}_n(a)\\in\\{1,\\ldots,|\\mathsf U_n|\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,e)=1\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{ord}_n(a)\\mid e\n\\quad(a\\in\\mathsf U_n,\\ e\\in\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对单位反复乘 a，有限群中的幂必重复，乘逆元得到某个正次幂为 1；故最小值存在。把 e 除以最小正周期，余数必须为零。对非单位不赋予假定存在的阶。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-modular-exponentiation","status":"resolved","id":"b39bd6838766ad96","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-modular-exponentiation]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\gcd(a,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf U_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf U_n\\coloneqq\\{a\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n-1\\}:\\gcd(a,n)=1\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ord}_n(a)\\coloneqq\\min\\{e\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}:\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,e)=1\\}\\quad(a\\in\\mathsf U_n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ord}_n(a)\\in\\{1,\\ldots,|\\mathsf U_n|\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,e)=1\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{ord}_n(a)\\mid e\n\\quad(a\\in\\mathsf U_n,\\ e\\in\\mathbb N).","display":true}],"bytes":1481,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-294","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-modular-multiplicative-order|模 n 单位与乘法阶]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"cc073a18f449598a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7a897c755ea1e057","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ff00e4aa0ef74db8","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["b39bd6838766ad96"]}